# 📋 MONGODB ATLAS SETUP INSTRUCTIONS
# ========================================
#
# 1. Go to: https://cloud.mongodb.com
# 2. Create free account (M0 tier)
# 3. Create cluster: "dxz-cluster"
# 4. Add database user: username/password
# 5. Allow network access: 0.0.0.0/0
# 6. Get connection string
# 7. Replace MONGO_URI above with your Atlas URI
# 8. Restart application: npm run dev
#
